+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-905.</span> Required date for filing property tax returns.<br /><br />
+	Notwithstanding any other provision of this title, every person required by law to make a property tax return to the county auditor must file the return with the county auditor on or before April thirtieth for property owned as of the preceding December thirty-first.<br /><br />
