+	(B) The road use fee imposed by this article is in lieu of all ad valorem taxes upon large commercial motor vehicles or buses, and any road use or other vehicle-related fees imposed by a political subdivision of this State.<br /><br />
+	(C) Counties shall mail bills for road use fees and registration to large commercial motor vehicles operating intrastate until the effective date of Section 12-37-2860(F).<br /><br />
+HISTORY: 1996 Act No. 461, SECTION 1; 1997 Act No. 125, SECTION 1H; 2017 Act No. 40 (H.3516), SECTION 8.A, eff January 1, 2019; 2021 Act No. 37 (H.3689), SECTION 9.A, eff July 1, 2021.<br /><br />
