+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 40-60-80.</span> Investigation of complaints and violations; stays; appeal.<br /><br />
+	(A) The department shall investigate complaints and violations of this chapter as provided in this chapter and Section 40-1-80.<br /><br />
